{"id": "De_ih5Xs7r-", "title": "Video by leogrundstrom", "description": "Comment “LINK” to get the free niche research system.\n\nThis new Claude integration finds faceless YouTube channels that are blowing up right now.\n\nIt’s called kloudboard, and it plugs straight into Claude as an MCP.\n\nYou describe a niche, and Claude pulls the faceless videos that are crushing their channel’s usual views.\n\nOne search for history documentaries found a channel with just 1.3K subscribers.\n\nIts video is sitting at over 400K views.\n\nThat’s a niche you can start in today.\n\nSo how do you set it up?\n\nNew users get 14 days free, with everything unlocked.\n\n1. Start your free kloudboard trial.\n2. Add its MCP link to Claude as a connector.\n3. Ask Claude for faceless niches under 100K subs with a viral video.\n\nIt does the research that used to take hours.\n\n#kloudboard #claude #facelessyoutube #youtubeautomation #aitools", "channel": "leogrundstrom", "uploader_id": "71015943272", "uploader": "Leo Grundström", "timestamp": 1793093481, "like_count": 291, "comment_count": 602, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1111605694943236a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.738, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMfEr7iZ4ydagR9qcYVoISf3-h281pVI8LL4Xh3YAB89VOPjzGXtYP-PPYFYWgeVA-e02DkRdkfEynB8EJzjR8k5x0NNL4vUQxbzXc.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=EMq97q2qHSMQ7kNvwEc-Tx_&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=2u2Dh9y4caSxqY2UVcEnzA&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQo_xB3fBiEZ0zx6bv3F-ybTA6MikhiqZCYZ89zmHM1Ig&oe=6AEB0EB9", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 60.738, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36